  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/48CAA8">Definition <span data-tag="48CAA8">5.2.9.6</span>.</a>generates!stronglystrongly generates Let $\calC $ be an $\infty $-category. We will say that a full subcategory $\calC ^{0} \subseteq \calC $ <em>strongly generates</em> $\calC $ if the inclusion functor $\calC ^{0} \rightarrow \calC $ strongly generates $\calC $, in the sense of Definition <a href="/tag/B35024" data-tag="B35024">5.2.9.2</a>. </p>
